Snowflake Virtual Warehouse — Important Syntax
1. Create Warehouse

CREATE WAREHOUSE my_wh
WITH
WAREHOUSE_SIZE = 'SMALL'
AUTO_SUSPEND = 300
AUTO_RESUME = TRUE
INITIALLY_SUSPENDED = TRUE;

2. Use Warehouse

USE WAREHOUSE my_wh;

3. Start / Resume Warehouse
ALTER WAREHOUSE my_wh RESUME;

4. Suspend Warehouse
ALTER WAREHOUSE my_wh SUSPEND;

5. Drop Warehouse
DROP WAREHOUSE my_wh;

6. Resize Warehouse
Scale Up
ALTER WAREHOUSE my_wh
SET WAREHOUSE_SIZE = 'LARGE';

7. Auto Suspend & Auto Resume

ALTER WAREHOUSE my_wh
SET AUTO_SUSPEND = 60
AUTO_RESUME = TRUE;

Meaning:

Suspend after 60 seconds idle
Automatically resume on query

8. Show Warehouses
SHOW WAREHOUSES;

9. Describe Warehouse
DESCRIBE WAREHOUSE my_wh;

10. Multi-Cluster Warehouse Syntax

CREATE WAREHOUSE multi_wh
WITH
WAREHOUSE_SIZE = 'MEDIUM'
MIN_CLUSTER_COUNT = 1
MAX_CLUSTER_COUNT = 3
SCALING_POLICY = 'STANDARD';

11. Set Multi-Cluster Later
ALTER WAREHOUSE multi_wh
SET
MIN_CLUSTER_COUNT = 1
MAX_CLUSTER_COUNT = 5;

