13. Query Using Warehouse
USE WAREHOUSE analytics_wh;

SELECT * FROM sales;

14. Create Warehouse with Comments
CREATE WAREHOUSE etl_wh
WITH
WAREHOUSE_SIZE = 'MEDIUM'
AUTO_SUSPEND = 120
COMMENT = 'Warehouse for ETL jobs';

15. Warehouse Cache Example
SELECT * FROM sales;

Repeated query on same warehouse:

May use SSD cache for faster performance

16. Check Running Queries
SHOW QUERIES;

17. Grant Warehouse Usage
GRANT USAGE
ON WAREHOUSE my_wh
TO ROLE analyst_role;

18. Revoke Warehouse Usage
REVOKE USAGE
ON WAREHOUSE my_wh
FROM ROLE analyst_role;

19. Example ETL Warehouse
CREATE WAREHOUSE etl_wh
WITH
WAREHOUSE_SIZE = 'LARGE'
AUTO_SUSPEND = 300
AUTO_RESUME = TRUE;

20. Example BI Warehouse
CREATE WAREHOUSE bi_wh
WITH
WAREHOUSE_SIZE = 'SMALL'
MIN_CLUSTER_COUNT = 1
MAX_CLUSTER_COUNT = 3;

